Hiqbah ERP — third-party fonts
==============================

This directory redistributes the WOFF2 font files that Google Fonts serves for the families
below, exactly as Google serves them (same bytes; source URL and sha256 of every file in
README.md, checksums in SHA256SUMS). They are Google's own builds of the upstream fonts: subset by
unicode-range, converted to WOFF2 and, for IBM Plex Sans, built as a variable font. They are
therefore Modified Versions of the original font software in the sense of the SIL Open Font
License, made by Google; this project has not changed, renamed or re-subset them.

Each family is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full licence text is
included next to the files of each family. The fonts are not sold by themselves.

